<title>MAURITIUS: Mauritius rupee weakens vs dollar, pound.</title>
<headline>Mauritius rupee weakens vs dollar, pound.</headline>
<dateline>PORT LOUIS 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Mauritian rupee weakened against both the dollar and sterling on Tuesday, reflecting international market trends, foreign exchange dealers said.</p>
<p>The rupee was quoted at a mean commercial rate of 21.8655 to the dollar compared with 21.8030 on Monday, and at 34.737 to the pound from 34.6375.</p>
<p>Dealers said few commercial banks were showing the intention to buy dollars on the interbank market.</p>
<p>--Clifford Vellien ++230 211-9555</p>
